        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Prevent Termination (Keep-Alive)",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Shields target processes from Jetsam and system low-memory kills. Apps are placed in a deep freeze the second they leave the screen, preserving state without consuming background CPU cycles.\n\n• **Power Draw:** Balanced",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Prevent Suspension (True Backgrounding)",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Forces apps to keep executing full run-loops in the background. Ideal for long-running uploads, active downloads, real-time GPS tracking, and uninterrupted VOIP polling.\n\n• **Power Draw:** Heavy",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Fast Freeze (Instant Halt)",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Bypasses default iOS background grace periods to pause CPU and network execution immediately on dismiss. Drops power draw to near zero while keeping the process warm in RAM.\n\n• **Power Draw:** Minimal",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Hybrid: Keep-Alive + Fast Freeze",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Combines memory immunity with instant halting: processes survive memory pressure sweeps but instantly sleep when unfocused.\n\n• **Power Draw:** Balanced",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 16
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Under the Hood & Features",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Custom Freeze Delay",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Dial in custom grace period sliders (in seconds) to let in-flight network requests wrap up cleanly before the app is put to sleep.",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "WhatsApp Push Fix (runningboardd)",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Fixes notification dropouts by raising memory limits on the WhatsApp Notification Extension.\n\n*Requires WhatsApp to have an active rule enabled in tweak preferences.*",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
